## Title: Phoenix UI - PvP
## Notes: Phoenix UI PvP: rated card with rating change, Gladiator / Legend / Strategist progress, weekly record and Great Vault, a scoreboard with columns you choose (other addons can add columns), the battleground leave countdown, Training Grounds and the Solo Shuffle round tracker. Arena frames live in Phoenix UI - Arena.
